    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "536f6a16_84845657",
        "filename": "include/linux/android_kabi.h",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 74,
      "author": {
        "id": 1930620
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-05T00:14:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Functionally it\u0027s the same, but I disagree we should prefer `__aligned_u64`. `__aligned_u64` adds a dependency on a UAPI header that we don\u0027t otherwise need, and also depends on a (admittedly widespread) compiler extension for `__attribute__((aligned(` instead of using the `_Alignas` core language feature. We could use `__aligned(8)` and move off the compiler extension with the rest of the kernel if someone ever sends a patch for that, but I don\u0027t think it\u0027s possible to use a type (instead of size) with it as is being done here.",
      "parentUuid": "6502ef1c_74628ac9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 74,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 74,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "c0471e902884235fd3f9e772316cea5659134c42",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "575623e2_51399aea",
        "filename": "include/linux/android_kabi.h",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 74,
      "author": {
        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-06-05T00:31:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How will this behave with older gcc toolchains (like the ones used by kernelci for some 32-bit builds). I see no evidence that this is a proposed standard practice for the linux kernel - perhaps it will be soon, but it isn\u0027t now. I quick peek at lore shows a few patches with alignas() (not _Alignas), but they were nak\u0027d (not necessarily because of the alignas()). Point is, this shouldn\u0027t be the first patch in the linux universe to land with alignas() - it should be an upstream patch. Please use the previous mechanism of your choice.",
      "parentUuid": "536f6a16_84845657",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 74,
        "startChar": 46,
        "endLine": 74,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "c0471e902884235fd3f9e772316cea5659134c42",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
